  "notes": "Warm off-white/stone neutrals with a dark slate top bar and a deep teal primary (#22566a). Amber marks everything that differs from last winter's profile: highlighted interval cells with a left accent rule and 'was 10 min', the warning banner, the 'Draft' and '1 request' badges, and amber left-rule notes in the side panel. A grey 'Live now' column shows what loggers run today. Mono font for every measured value. Deployment group header rows carry depth, active count and telemetry type, and the Main Buoy group is collapsed ('Out of water from Dec 2', Show sensors). The right panel works as a staged-changeset reviewer: switch-over date/time, a Changes list with Revert and a reason textarea that feeds change history, a 'Before you schedule' checklist, and a sticky Schedule CTA. Filed proposal 'staged-changes' for this. Bulk action bar appears only on row selection (verified live)."
